<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Sawtooth Mountain Road</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:116-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.563099" lon="-121.666074"><ele>389.8</ele><name>Last house on Road 13</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:lost-lake-last-house (OSM node 8938607273 on Lost Lake Road); confidence: medium; pdf_page: 117; book_elev_ft: 1270; quote: The road from Dee is plowed 3 miles to the last house (1,270 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.532409" lon="-121.743428"><ele>551.7</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 18 (Lolo Pass road) junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 33443907, as in 115-1; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 1880; quote: This basin contains the junction with Road 18, the Lolo Pass road, at 1,880 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.520036" lon="-121.756815"><ele>671.3</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 1340 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 2377671132, as in 115-1; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 2200; quote: in 1.6 miles passes to the left a side road (Road 1340)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.513828" lon="-121.779256"><ele>820.7</ele><name>Road 13 / Road 1350 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 33439581, FR 13 and NF 1350 Sawtooth Mountain Road; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 2720; quote: Three miles beyond the Lolo Pass road junction ... a side road to the right at 2,720 feet</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.529182" lon="-121.770537"><ele>899.3</ele><name>Big bend on Road 1350</name><desc>source: OSM node where NF 1350011 leaves NF 1350 at the road's hairpin, 1.42 mi from Road 13 (book 0.5 + 0.9 = 1.4); DEM 2,950 ft; confidence: high; pdf_page: 118; quote: Another 0.9 mile along the south-facing slopes brings you to a big road bend. Take the first road to the right</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.530730" lon="-121.765747"><ele>894.7</ele><name>Ridgetop road end viewpoint</name><desc>source: OSM NF 1350011 vertex 0.28 mi from the bend, where the level ridgetop (2,945 ft by DEM) ends; the TIGER line runs on 0.27 mi more, dropping 200 ft, so the book's road end is taken here; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 118; book_elev_ft: 2960; quote: ski east 0.3 mile along a ridgetop to the road's end ... Elevation gain from Road 13 is only 240 feet!</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Sawtooth Mountain Road</name><desc>1. Last house on Road 13 -&gt; Road 13 / Road 18 (Lolo Pass road) junction: osm (high), 4.68 mi | 2. Road 13 / Road 18 (Lolo Pass road) junction -&gt; Road 13 / Road 1340 junction: osm (high), 1.55 mi | 3. Road 13 / Road 1340 junction -&gt; Road 13 / Road 1350 junction: osm (high), 1.44 mi | 4. Road 13 / Road 1350 junction -&gt; Big bend on Road 1350: osm (high), 1.42 mi | 5. Big bend on Road 1350 -&gt; Ridgetop road end viewpoint: osm (medium), 0.28 mi</desc>
